# Sign in — our own auth, dogfooded

The native email/password sign-in for the cloud platform — **our own auth** (`Nexus.Auth`), no
external IdP. A centered card on the brand's pastel aurora, matching the onboarding/authorize design.
Posts to the nexus's `/auth/{login,signup,forgot}` endpoints; a verified credential issues a
`Nexus.Auth.Session` cookie and lands on the dashboard. This is a `.work` workbook served by the same
nexus as everything else — the login lives in the dogfood pile too.

design :login do
  *{box-sizing:border-box}
  :root{--ink:#16161a;--paper:#f7f6f1;--card:#fff;--line:#e7e5db;--dim:#6a6f68;
    --mint:#aee5c2;--sky:#a8d4f0;--peach:#f3c5a3;--cream:#f2ddb0;--violet:#d9c5f0;
    --sans:'Geist',system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,sans-serif}
  body{margin:0;min-height:100vh;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--sans);
    display:grid;place-items:center;overflow:hidden}
  /* The nexus wraps each .work file in a <section class="file">; dissolve those from layout so the
     card is a direct grid child of body and place-items:center truly centers it (was landing in the
     second grid row = too low, and left-aligned within its wrapper = off-center). */
  body > section.file{display:contents}
  /* soft drifting pastel blobs (the onboarding aurora) */
  .blobs{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:0;filter:blur(64px);opacity:.55;pointer-events:none}
  .blobs span{position:absolute;width:46vmax;height:46vmax;border-radius:50%;background:var(--c);
    animation:drift 26s ease-in-out infinite alternate}
  @keyframes drift{to{transform:translate(4vmax,-3vmax) scale(1.12)}}
  .card{position:relative;z-index:1;width:380px;max-width:92vw;background:var(--card);
    border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;padding:34px 30px 30px;
    box-shadow:0 24px 60px -28px rgba(20,20,26,.35)}
  .mark{width:42px;height:auto;color:var(--ink);display:block;margin:0 0 18px}
  .mark svg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}
  h1{font-size:21px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:0 0 4px}
  .sub{font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--dim);margin:0 0 22px}
  label{display:block;font:600 11px var(--sans);letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--dim);margin:0 0 5px}
  .field{margin:0 0 14px}
  input{width:100%;padding:11px 13px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:11px;
    font:500 14px var(--sans);color:var(--ink);background:var(--paper);outline:none}
  input:focus{border-color:var(--sky);background:#fff}
  .btn{width:100%;padding:12px;border:0;border-radius:11px;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;
    font:700 14px var(--sans);cursor:pointer;transition:transform .1s,filter .1s}
  .btn:hover{filter:brightness(1.12)}
  .btn:active{transform:translateY(1px)}
  .btn[disabled]{opacity:.6;cursor:default}
  .row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin:0 0 18px}
  .lk{background:none;border:0;color:var(--dim);font:600 12.5px var(--sans);cursor:pointer;padding:0}
  .lk:hover{color:var(--ink)}
  .toggle{text-align:center;font-size:13px;color:var(--dim);margin:18px 0 0}
  .toggle button{background:none;border:0;color:var(--ink);font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;padding:0}
  .msg{font-size:13px;border-radius:10px;padding:9px 12px;margin:0 0 16px;display:none}
  .msg.err{display:block;background:#fdeceb;color:#b3261e}
  .msg.ok{display:block;background:#eaf7ef;color:#1b7a43}
end

